    <Point><coordinates>28.89089,-28.72744,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Golden Gate · Glen Reenen</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Golden_Gate_Highlands_National_Park,_South_Africa_(Unsplash).jpg?width=1200" width="320"/><br/><b>Media · Naturaleza</b><br/>Glen Reenen es el campamento y base real de Golden Gate Highlands, entre paredones de arenisca. Sustituye un pin paisajístico impreciso.<br/><b>Perro:</b> prohibido<br/><a href="https://theawakeman.github.io/africa2027/paises/sudafrica/#poi-10">Ver ficha completa</a> · <a href="https://www.google.com/maps?q=-28.50629,28.61878">Google Maps</a>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#icon-poi-verde</styleUrl>
